WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.001
-Republicans at the

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:04.571
Conservative
Political Action Conference

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:07.106
this weekend
cheered low vaccination rates

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:09.042
as COVID cases were rising

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:11.043
in states where
vaccinations have lagged.

00:00:11.043 --> 00:00:13.613
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:17.717
♪♪

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:20.253
The Trump era revealed a lot
about our politics,

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:23.088
but one main thing is
that many prominent Republicans

00:00:23.088 --> 00:00:24.757 line:0%
are just super weird.

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:26.192 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
Here, for example,

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.528 line:0%
is Donald Trump Jr.
just being super weird

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.863 line:0%
while trying to tell
some incomprehensible jokes

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:32.699 line:0%
at the Conservative
Political Action Conference

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:33.899 line:0%
in Dallas over the weekend.

00:00:33.899 --> 00:00:36.068 line:0%
-Texas has always
led the charge.

00:00:36.068 --> 00:00:39.672 line:0%
[ Cheering
and applause ]

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:42.608 line:0%
Well, 'til about like
a couple of months ago,

00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:44.043 line:0%
and then,
Austin sort of took over.

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:45.077 line:0%
Like I don't know, guys.

00:00:45.077 --> 00:00:46.712 line:0%
Like Texas was leading
the charge.

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:48.348 line:0%
You're still Top 25.

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:50.083 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:51.251 line:0%
But we got to work on that stuff

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:53.185 line:0%
because those people
have lost their minds.

00:00:53.185 --> 00:00:55.355 line:0%
[ Isolated cheering
and applause ]

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:56.589 line:0%
Right?

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.758 line:0%
-California!

00:00:58.758 --> 00:00:59.826
-Ooh!

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:00.960
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.762
Last time somebody
bombed that badly,

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:04.163
he became the Joker.

00:01:04.163 --> 00:01:05.765
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.700
Don Jr. looked like he just
walked into a scene

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.903
in a student improv show
and blanked.

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:12.772
Don, you said freeze.

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:14.607
You got to have something.

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:15.941
Why is he looking
off to the side?

00:01:15.941 --> 00:01:16.943
Is the Sandman there,

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:18.177
about to sweep him
off the stage?

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:20.579
Don Jr. has all the charm
and charisma

00:01:20.579 --> 00:01:22.782
of a dude selling time-shares
in a hotel conference room

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:24.350
whose PowerPoint just crashed.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.586
[ As Don Jr ]
Texas has so many
great opportunities,

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.621
as you can see here.
Okay, nope.

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:30.757
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:32.191
Not getting a picture here,

00:01:32.191 --> 00:01:35.828
but we know -- we know
the big towns in Texas, right?

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:37.597
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:40.800
Dallas.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.801
How-ston.

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:44.237
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:45.738
Saint Tonio.
That's not right.

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.407
Oh, I think I'm going
to pass out.

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:49.042
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:50.142
It's one thing
to be a Republican

00:01:50.142 --> 00:01:51.411
and believe Republican things,

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:53.980
but they always take it
to such weird extremes,

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.982
like Tennessee
Senator Marsha Blackburn,

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:57.649
who, for some reason,
last week decided

00:01:57.649 --> 00:01:59.886
to go on a bizarre rant
about how, under socialism,

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:02.421 line:0%
Taylor Swift wouldn't be
allowed to perform music.

00:02:02.421 --> 00:02:03.856 line:0%
-When I'm talking to my friends

00:02:03.856 --> 00:02:06.325 line:0%
who are musicians
and entertainers

00:02:06.325 --> 00:02:12.098 line:0%
I say, "If -- If -- we have
a socialistic government,

00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:15.067 line:0%
if we have Marxism,

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:20.539 line:0%
you are going to be the first
ones who will be cut off

00:02:20.539 --> 00:02:24.710 line:0%
because the state would have
to approve your music."

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:27.513 line:0%
And, you know,
Taylor Swift came after me

00:02:27.513 --> 00:02:30.383 line:0%
in my 2018 campaign,

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:33.619 line:0%
but Taylor Swift would be
the first victim of that

00:02:33.619 --> 00:02:38.391 line:0%
because, when you look
at Marxist socialist societies,

00:02:38.391 --> 00:02:44.997 line:0%
they do not allow women
to dress or sing or be onstage

00:02:44.997 --> 00:02:50.002 line:0%
or to entertain or the type
music that she would have.

00:02:50.002 --> 00:02:51.971
-First of all,
what you're describing sounds

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:53.573
like a record company,
not socialism.

00:02:53.573 --> 00:02:57.076
Second, even if you were
a repressive dictator,

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:59.745
the last person you'd want to go
after would be Taylor Swift

00:02:59.745 --> 00:03:02.649
because she will write a song
about your bad behavior

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:04.750
and it will be
the song of the summer

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.819
and even your closest friends
will sing along to it

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:08.521
at barbecues you are at

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:10.022
and then, when they make
eye contact with you,

00:03:10.022 --> 00:03:11.523
they'll pretend like
they're not singing along,

00:03:11.523 --> 00:03:13.926
but you'll know they were.

00:03:13.926 --> 00:03:15.227
They were.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.227 --> 00:03:17.630
And they'll say, "Hey, are you
the guy in fatigues

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:18.998
who's fatiguing her?"
And you'll be like,

00:03:18.998 --> 00:03:20.866
"I don't know.
It could be anybody,"

00:03:20.866 --> 00:03:22.535
but you'll know it's you.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.535 --> 00:03:24.203
But it's true.
Everyone knows that,

00:03:24.203 --> 00:03:26.539
in countries with robust
social welfare programs,

00:03:26.539 --> 00:03:29.242
women are not allowed
to sing or be onstage.

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:31.276
That's why the Icelandic
government famously tried

00:03:31.276 --> 00:03:33.279
to outlaw Bjork,
until she raised

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:35.281
an army of me.

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:36.749
And that's today's jork,

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:38.885 line:0%
♪♪
which is an Icelandic word,

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:40.153 line:0%
meaning "joke about Bjork."

00:03:40.153 --> 00:03:43.756 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.756 --> 00:03:46.359
Now, to be clear, I have no idea
what Blackburn is talking about.

00:03:46.359 --> 00:03:47.660
It's hard to make sense
of what goes

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:48.661
through these people heads.

00:03:48.661 --> 00:03:49.728
It's like trying
to follow directions

00:03:49.728 --> 00:03:51.097
from an annoyed Parisian.

00:03:51.097 --> 00:03:55.301
I think he said the Louvre is
inside that McDonald's?

00:03:55.301 --> 00:03:58.604
I think what he said was,
"That's your Louvre."

00:03:58.604 --> 00:04:00.173
That seems very rude.
With that said,

00:04:00.173 --> 00:04:01.441
do you want to go to McDonald's?

00:04:01.441 --> 00:04:02.541
[ Laughter ]
So Republicans think the left

00:04:02.541 --> 00:04:03.542
wants to ban music.

00:04:03.542 --> 00:04:04.977
They're also now arguing

00:04:04.977 --> 00:04:06.078
that the Biden administration

00:04:06.078 --> 00:04:07.981
is going to use
COVID vaccine outreach

00:04:07.981 --> 00:04:10.216
as an excuse to come to your
door and invade your privacy.

00:04:10.216 --> 00:04:12.485
Texas Senator Ted Cruz
tweeted last week...

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:23.896
Ted, please stop using slang
like G-man.

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:26.232
You sound like
a rejected Dick Tracy villain.

00:04:26.232 --> 00:04:29.569
[ As Pacino ]
Beardsy McScraggle is in charge
of our getaway.

00:04:29.569 --> 00:04:30.670
[ As Cruz ]
Good news, Big Boy.

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.771
I booked us all
on a flight to Cancun.

00:04:32.771 --> 00:04:34.339
Bad news.
It comes back tomorrow.

00:04:34.339 --> 00:04:37.443
[ As Pacino ]
I want Beardsy McScraggle dead!

00:04:37.443 --> 00:04:39.578
[ Laughter ]

00:04:39.578 --> 00:04:41.847
Pacino got Oscar-nominated
for that role

00:04:41.847 --> 00:04:42.915
and, for that,

00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:45.884
the academy should be applauded.

00:04:45.884 --> 00:04:49.655
And, yes, I spent the last
two weeks at impression camp.

00:04:49.655 --> 00:04:51.190
[ Laughter ]

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.092
As a counselor!

00:04:53.092 --> 00:04:57.296
[ Laughter ]

00:04:57.296 --> 00:04:59.965
Republicans have to spin
elaborate conspiracy theories

00:04:59.965 --> 00:05:02.068
about otherwise humane,
sensible policies

00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:03.135
because that's all they have.

00:05:03.135 --> 00:05:05.537
It's not threatening or ominous

00:05:05.537 --> 00:05:07.272
to raise awareness
about vaccines.

00:05:07.272 --> 00:05:09.308
That's why there was never
a straight-to-video

00:05:09.308 --> 00:05:11.810
Steven Seagal movie called...

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:13.312
Although I do think
I just saw a trailer

00:05:13.312 --> 00:05:15.448
for a new Liam Neeson movie
called...

00:05:15.448 --> 00:05:17.050
...where he rides
in a literal wagon

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:18.450
and welcomes a gang to town.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:19.719
[ As Neeson ]
With his fists.

00:05:19.719 --> 00:05:21.554
I think you'll find
we have a nice library

00:05:21.554 --> 00:05:22.688
and a lovely park,

00:05:22.688 --> 00:05:24.323
but you really want to check out

00:05:24.323 --> 00:05:26.392
our graveyard.

00:05:26.392 --> 00:05:28.394
We didn't get to that
at Impressions camp.

00:05:28.394 --> 00:05:29.462
[ Laughter ]

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:30.563
[Clap]

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:32.164
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.164 --> 00:05:34.167
Because you made me come back!

00:05:34.167 --> 00:05:37.336
[ Laughter ]

00:05:37.336 --> 00:05:38.871
It makes sense to go
to communities

00:05:38.871 --> 00:05:40.406
where vaccination rates
are lagging

00:05:40.406 --> 00:05:41.574
and reach out
to people directly,

00:05:41.574 --> 00:05:44.010
especially since,
in those same places,

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.678
COVID cases are,
once again, rising.

00:05:45.678 --> 00:05:47.513
It's not
about government control.

00:05:47.513 --> 00:05:49.481
It's about saving lives.

00:05:49.481 --> 00:05:51.017
CBS reported this weekend
that...

00:05:55.788 --> 00:05:57.690
I can't believe
it's even necessary

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.024
to say that, but here we are.

00:05:59.024 --> 00:06:01.327
It's like saying
all the red people at the beach

00:06:01.327 --> 00:06:02.895
are the ones
who didn't wear sunscreen.

00:06:02.895 --> 00:06:06.766
[ Laughter ]
We know what the
sunscreen's for.

00:06:06.766 --> 00:06:09.335
There's nothing nefarious
about community outreach

00:06:09.335 --> 00:06:11.370
to get more people
to take life-saving vaccines.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.138
Just listen to Biden
describe the plan.

00:06:13.138 --> 00:06:15.508
-Now, we need to go
community by community,

00:06:15.508 --> 00:06:18.044
neighborhood by neighborhood,
and, ofttimes,

00:06:18.044 --> 00:06:20.646
door to door,
literally knocking on doors,

00:06:20.646 --> 00:06:22.948
to get help
to the remaining people.

00:06:22.948 --> 00:06:24.550
-All he's talking about is
raising awareness

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:26.085
in areas
with low vaccination rates.

00:06:26.085 --> 00:06:28.387
Joe Biden isn't going
to personally knock
on your door.

00:06:28.387 --> 00:06:29.622
The only time Biden's
ever knocked

00:06:29.622 --> 00:06:31.023
on a neighbor's door is
to let them know

00:06:31.023 --> 00:06:32.725
he's about to set off
a ton of fireworks.

00:06:32.725 --> 00:06:35.027
[ As Biden ]
I just wanted to give you
the heads up,

00:06:35.027 --> 00:06:37.029
in case it freaks out your dog.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:37.029 --> 00:06:38.664
We desperately need
elected leaders

00:06:38.664 --> 00:06:39.965
and influential Republicans

00:06:39.965 --> 00:06:41.767
to help get as many people
vaccinated as possible,

00:06:41.767 --> 00:06:44.536
especially since a lot
of the people refusing the shots

00:06:44.536 --> 00:06:46.105
are Trump supporters
in deep red states.

00:06:46.105 --> 00:06:47.440
And, yet, instead,

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.275
Republicans are spreading
insane conspiracy theories

00:06:49.275 --> 00:06:50.809
about Biden's community
outreach plan,

00:06:50.809 --> 00:06:53.880
purely as a political tactic
to scare voters.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:57.683
-Marjorie Taylor Greene
tweeting this --

00:06:57.683 --> 00:07:00.987
"Biden pushing a vaccine
that is NOT FDA approved..."

00:07:12.865 --> 00:07:15.201
-We're here to tell government

00:07:15.201 --> 00:07:17.370
we don't want your benefits.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.038 line:0%
We don't want your welfare.

00:07:19.038 --> 00:07:20.806 line:0%
Don't come knocking on my door

00:07:20.806 --> 00:07:22.308 line:0%
with your Fauci ouchie.

00:07:22.308 --> 00:07:24.543 line:0%
You leave us the hell alone!

00:07:24.543 --> 00:07:27.113
-And, now, they're starting
to talk about going door to door

00:07:27.113 --> 00:07:29.681
to be able to take vaccines
to the people.

00:07:29.681 --> 00:07:31.450 line:0%
Think about the mechanisms
they would have to build

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:34.186 line:0%
to be able to actually execute
that massive of a thing

00:07:34.186 --> 00:07:35.387 line:0%
and then, think about what

00:07:35.387 --> 00:07:36.722 line:0%
those mechanisms
could be used for.

00:07:36.722 --> 00:07:38.457 line:0%
They could then go door to door,
take your guns.

00:07:38.457 --> 00:07:40.392 line:0%
They could then go door
to door, take your Bible.

00:07:40.392 --> 00:07:43.896
-You think the government has
to build a whole new mechanism

00:07:43.896 --> 00:07:46.498
to go door to door to raise
awareness about vaccines,

00:07:46.498 --> 00:07:48.000
which they could then use

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.402
to take away Bibles
and your guns?

00:07:49.402 --> 00:07:51.003
Have you ever heard
of the Postal Service?

00:07:51.003 --> 00:07:54.106
Imagine government workers going
door to door in their high socks

00:07:54.106 --> 00:07:56.409
and their bucket hats
and their short shorts,

00:07:56.409 --> 00:07:59.311
coming to your house to take
away your Bibles and your guns

00:07:59.311 --> 00:08:00.679
and your outgoing mail.

00:08:00.679 --> 00:08:02.615
Next thing you're going to know,
they're going to tell you

00:08:02.615 --> 00:08:04.316
I need to put a stamp
on my mail

00:08:04.316 --> 00:08:06.285
and that I can't just stuff
the cute neighborhood cat

00:08:06.285 --> 00:08:08.287
in the box
and write "Abu Dhabi" on it.

00:08:08.287 --> 00:08:10.556
Well, last I checked,
mailing a cat to Abu Dhabi

00:08:10.556 --> 00:08:13.091
was my God-given,
constitutional right.

00:08:13.091 --> 00:08:15.428
What's next,
I'm not allowed to hate Mondays?

00:08:15.428 --> 00:08:16.429
[ Laughter ]

00:08:16.429 --> 00:08:18.130
COVID cases are,
once again, on the rise,

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:19.365
especially in parts
of the country

00:08:19.365 --> 00:08:21.067
where vaccination rates
are lagging

00:08:21.067 --> 00:08:23.168
and a contagious new variant
is spreading.

00:08:23.168 --> 00:08:24.403
We desperately need to get

00:08:24.403 --> 00:08:26.205
as many people vaccinated
as possible.

00:08:26.205 --> 00:08:28.974
The evidence that these vaccines
are safe and effective

00:08:28.974 --> 00:08:31.143
is overwhelming,
from both clinical trials

00:08:31.143 --> 00:08:32.611
and real-world studies.

00:08:32.611 --> 00:08:33.645
And yet, over the weekend,

00:08:33.645 --> 00:08:35.614
attendees at the CPAC
cheered the news

00:08:35.614 --> 00:08:38.250
that the Biden administration
has not been able

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:40.786
to get as many Americans
vaccinated as they hoped for.

00:08:40.786 --> 00:08:43.255
-They were hoping,
the government was hoping,

00:08:43.255 --> 00:08:45.925
that they could sort of sucker
90% of the population

00:08:45.925 --> 00:08:50.963
into getting vaccinated
and it isn't happening, right?

00:08:50.963 --> 00:08:53.966 line:0%
[ Cheering and applause ]
Younger people

00:08:53.966 --> 00:08:56.669 line:0%
are well aware
of what the risks really are.

00:08:56.669 --> 00:08:58.203
-Ugh! That's
the political equivalent

00:08:58.203 --> 00:09:00.672
of clapping when a waiter
drops some dishes.

00:09:00.672 --> 00:09:02.641
That's the worst thing
I've ever seen a crowd cheer for

00:09:02.641 --> 00:09:05.410
since Alice Cooper bit the head
off a live chicken onstage.

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:08.447
[ Laughter ]
And, yeah, maybe it happened
in 1969,

00:09:08.447 --> 00:09:10.182
but maybe I was there.
You don't know.

00:09:10.182 --> 00:09:12.084
Maybe I'm secretly
in my late 60s.

00:09:12.084 --> 00:09:13.586
Ever wonder what I look like
before I shave

00:09:13.586 --> 00:09:14.853
and put on all this makeup?

00:09:14.853 --> 00:09:16.555
Here's a pic
from our hiatus last week

00:09:16.555 --> 00:09:18.690
and I look good!
[ Laughter ]

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:20.358
I'll work on those old-man abs.

00:09:20.358 --> 00:09:21.627
Every morning at 5:00 am,

00:09:21.627 --> 00:09:23.396
I swim the length
of the East River

00:09:23.396 --> 00:09:25.497
and then, I meet up
with Wally at the gym.

00:09:25.497 --> 00:09:27.633
He counts my squats
via cue card.

00:09:27.633 --> 00:09:31.403
[ Laughter ]

00:09:31.403 --> 00:09:32.805
This is what
the Republican Party

00:09:32.805 --> 00:09:34.473
and right-wing media
have wrought --

00:09:34.473 --> 00:09:36.876
a movement that celebrates
low vaccination rates

00:09:36.876 --> 00:09:38.643
and spins
insane conspiracy theories

00:09:38.643 --> 00:09:39.812
about attempts to get

00:09:39.812 --> 00:09:41.681
more people to take
a life-saving vaccine.

00:09:41.681 --> 00:09:43.382
If Republicans
had any shame at all,

00:09:43.382 --> 00:09:45.750
they'd look inward and ask
themselves how they got here,

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:46.819
but they won't because...

00:09:46.819 --> 00:09:48.420 line:0%
-Those people
have lost their minds.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:51.057 line:0%
[ Isolated cheering
and applause ]

00:09:51.057 --> 00:09:52.158 line:0%
Right?

00:09:52.158 --> 00:09:55.394
[ Laughter ]

00:10:01.366 --> 00:10:02.568
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:02.568 --> 00:10:06.505
♪♪

00:10:06.505 --> 00:10:08.073
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:10:08.073 --> 00:10:09.374
over two million meals a year

00:10:09.374 --> 00:10:11.777
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:10:11.777 --> 00:10:13.445
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:10:13.445 --> 00:10:15.180
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:17.349
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:10:17.349 --> 00:10:20.419
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

